<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMANY AND NORTHERN IRELAND DRAW 1-1 IN QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMANY AND NORTHERN IRELAND DRAW 1-1 IN QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>NUREMBERG, Germany 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany and Northern</p>
<p>Ireland drew (halftime 1-1) in their World Cup European group</p>
<p>nine qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Germany - Andy Moeller 41</p>
<p>Northern Ireland - Gerry Taggart 39</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,718</p>
